  <selectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry name="Relics (Reference)" id="d99e-9556-c5f6-0407" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="-4" type="upgrade">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="8c12-fc52-3844-1e0d" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="9cd6-0442-3f35-6b52"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="f5e5-d983-d892-9541" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="6cbb-cba9-064d-978c-min" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="6cbb-cba9-064d-978c-max" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Resilient (X)" id="43bd-d1b8-ce34-1ed1" hidden="false" targetId="253c-c1fa-d29d-d21e" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="1 Dust Aegis" id="680a-7c95-55fa-ef82" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">This unit gains Resilient 6+. While this unit is within 16&quot; of a friendly unit with Psyker, add 1 to Resilient Rolls made for this unit.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Siphoning Sigil" id="f2b2-9452-7098-7d53" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">For each Psychic Test this unit makes, add 1 D6 to that Psychic Test for each other unit with Psyker in the battlefield. For each Psychic Test an enemy unit makes while within 12&quot; of this unit, that unit&apos;s Psyker X is worsened by 1 for that Psychic Test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Staff of Influence" id="37f8-515f-c8ad-7d58" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit gains this ability or is Activated, you may&apos;influence fate&apos;. If you do, discard all your influence dice. Then, make a Psychic Test for this unit. Keep these dice (and their results) aside as your&apos;influence dice&apos;. While this unit has this ability, for each attack that targets this unit, instead of making a Saving Throw for that attack, you may&apos;spend influence&apos;. To spend influence, discard one of those influence dice equal to or greater than the required result for that Saving Throw. If you do, that Saving Throw is successful.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Unholy Ammunition" id="87b7-363e-8ccf-df89" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">For each attack this unit makes with a weapon with Inferno, after a successful Wound Roll for that attack, the target unit for that attack suffers X SW where X is the Damage of that attack.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 Tablet of Treason" id="094e-964e-533c-405a" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After this unit&apos;s Move step, you may select an enemy unit visible to and within 16&quot; of this unit. Roll X D6 where X is the number of models in the selected unit. For each 4+, select a model in that unit or you may instead select one leader model. Then, the selected models make ranged attacks and you select the targets for those attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Trespassers’ Ring" id="0aed-2950-6019-dced" hidden="false" typeId="9b56-9768-f88b-14ac" typeName="Relics">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="becf-f398-aed2-688b">After any enemy unit&apos;s Move step, as a reaction, if that unit is visible to this unit, you may roll a D6. On a 5+, this unit may Reposition up to 3D6&quot; and may move through enemy models and terrain as if they were not there while doing so.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Psychic Powers (Reference)" id="0171-0833-7fc4-972d" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="-3" type="upgrade">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="f360-8a68-627a-fe58" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="9cd6-0442-3f35-6b52"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="2961-1d3e-4adf-052e" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="3818-5dec-525f-9143-min" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="min" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="3818-5dec-525f-9143-max" field="selections" includeChildSelections="false" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="1 Psychic Subjugation" id="e9cf-3e6f-ea5c-76e7" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select an enemy unit within 16&quot; of this unit. The selected unit suffers XD3 Suppression where X is this unit&apos;s Psyker X.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="2 Destiny&apos;s Doorstep" id="989b-95ed-8fbb-e4e1" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">If this unit is in reserves, roll 3D6. You may Deploy it at least X” away from all enemy units where X is the result. Otherwise, this unit may Reposition up to 3D6&quot; and may move over terrain and models as if they were not there while doing so.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="3 Temporal Manipulation" id="de1e-1879-559a-5b39" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">Select a friendly unit within 9” of this model. Select and apply one of the following effects:


a) After the next time you roll for initiative, the selected unit Heals X+1 where X is this unit’s Psyker X.

b) The selected unit Heals X where X is this unit&apos;s Psyker X.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="4 Tzeentch’s Labyrinth" id="fcd2-d13d-fa07-9cb0" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you select targets for this unit this turn, select up to one debris terrain piece within 18&quot; of this unit. Remove the selected debris from the battlefield. Then, place the debris anywhere in the battlefield. Do not place it on any terrain, objectives, or models. After moving that terrain, each enemy unit within 3&quot; of that terrain suffers X SW where X is this unit&apos;s Psyker X.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="5 Bolt of Change" id="9351-c256-d375-0321" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you would select targets for this unit this turn, select one visible enemy unit within 16&quot; of this unit. It suffers XD3+1 SW where X is this unit&apos;s Psyker X.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="6 Immolating Vortex" id="6317-f3a9-67ef-7902" hidden="false" typeId="6406-cf2b-ec5b-c7e6" typeName="Psychic Power">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="4b9e-dc73-b312-b42d">After you would select targets for this unit this turn, select any point in the battlefield within 16&quot; of and visible to this unit. Each enemy unit within XD3&quot; of the selected point, where X is the number of times this psychic power has been Cast this battle, suffers 2 SW.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry name="Army Rules" id="368e-26e3-98ff-35c3" hidden="false" import="true" sortIndex="-2" type="upgrade">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Configuration" id="c0fe-5b1b-b5ff-cefe" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="9cd6-0442-3f35-6b52"/>
