      </infoLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Warp Vortex" id="3583-594a-42e6-aa27" hidden="false" typeId="e9b6-89e0-ffee-5662" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description:" typeId="22b9-735d-71b1-6d7a">After this unit&apos;s Move step, it loses whichever of the following abilities it has if any, then roll a D3 and this unit gains the following ability equal to the result: 1. Reality Transposition: After this unit gains this ability, this unit may Reposition up to 9+D6&quot;. During this move, you may move through terrain and models as if they were not there. 2. Wyrding Aurora: After this unit&apos;s Move step, all units within 9&quot; of this unit suffer D6+1 SW. 3. Beam of Unreality: After this unit&apos;s Move step, select a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit. Draw a line between the selected unit and this unit. The selected unit and each unit that line passes over suffers D6+1 SW.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <selectionEntries>
        <selectionEntry name="Mutalith Vortex Beast" id="603c-cd16-33de-7e9a" hidden="false" import="true" type="model">
          <constraints>
